# HuntUpstream-2: TF_GLM_DRAFT_SKIP, ported from MiaAI-Lab recipe PR #205's patches/0125-glm-prompt-draft-skip-partial16.patch
# (mxfp0, Apache-2.0; the DRAFT_SKIP half only, not PARTIAL16, which needs the bf16-partials numerics trade). A prompt
# chunk's DFlash2 taps are committed only within the ring's reach (2,176 rows) before a point the context is read at
# (the lane's stops, its kept point, the prompt's end); the context end moves past the rest. Off by default
# (TF_GLM_DRAFT_SKIP=1 turns it on); joins the ranks' startup comparison. Replies: unchanged by construction (drafts
# never change a reply); drafter ring rows every point reads: equal to the full commit's (test_draft_skip.py).
# Apply: cd work/hunt/tree/.. && patch -p0 < HuntUpstream-2-draft-skip.patch
